PART I — TABVENTO PLATFORM & SOLANA WEB3 ACTIVATION TERMS
================================================================================

1. Simulated Demo Mode (Free Evaluation):
   Anyone downloading Tabvento from GitHub may run and explore the local
   dashboard in Simulated Demo Mode (`mode: "demo"`) at `http://127.0.0.1:8765`
   free of charge, without API keys or prior payment.

2. Live Browser Mode (`mode: "live"`) Activation via Solana:
   Official activation of Live Browser Mode in the Tabvento dashboard requires
   an on-chain verified contribution on Solana Mainnet to the project's
   official wallet:
   - Official Solana Wallet: 3HvUMCUSSHEdtA35UuD4J7mbgpTxJ7LgT2X7GfdzvBdm
   - Minimum Contribution: $88 USD (in native SOL or SPL USDC)
   - Maximum Limit: No maximum limit (any contribution >= $88 USD is valid)

3. GitHub Compliance, Security & Attribution:
   - Always retain this `LICENSE` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` in all copies
     or distributions.
   - Never commit or publish `.env` files, AI provider keys, cookies, SQLite
     databases, or private mission history to GitHub repositories.
   - External AI model usage is billed directly by the user's chosen provider
     using their own keys in `.env` (or free locally via Ollama).
   - Bypassing, spoofing, or redistributing unauthorized activation records
     for Tabvento Live Browser Mode is prohibited.

